    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pashû, muana wa Imê muakuidi, wakadi kahita kanene ka bakuidi mu nsubu wa Yehowa, wakunvua mei a Yelemiya hakambeye malu â. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Pashû wakakuma muprofete Yelemiya, wakamubuesha mu bikunyi biakadi hehi ne tshibi tshia Benyamina tshia ha mutu, tshiakadi mu nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshiabu, Pashû wakahatula Yelemiya mu bikunyi. Mu diba adi Yelemiya wakamuambila ne, Yehowa kena ukuidika dina ne, Pashû, kadi wakukuidika ne, Buowaku-Nseke-Yonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.3:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dina edi mu Buena Ebelu didi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mago-misabiba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mona, nenkuvuishe bu mukuatshiki wa buowa kûdi wewe mene ne kudi balunda bebe bonso. Nebashihibue ku muele wa nvita wa bena lukuna babo, ne mesu ebe neamone muanda eu. Nenfile ba mu Yuda bonso mu bianza bia mukelenge wa Babulona kabidi, ne yeye neaye nʼabo mu buhika mu Babulona, neabashihe ne muele wa nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenfile kabidi biuma bionso bia musoko eu, luhetu luau luonso ne bintu biau bia mushinga mukole bionso, ne bintu bionso bia mu bibutshilu bia bakelenge ba Yuda mu bianza bia bena lukuna babo; bobo nebabihaule, nebabiangate, nebaye nʼabi ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne wewe, Pashû, ne bonso badi bashikame mu nsubu muebe, nenuye mu buhika. Wewe neuye ku Babulona, neufuileku, nebakujikeku, wewe ne balunda bebe bonso bawakuambila mei a mashimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
